          {
            "user": "agent_917a0837-a726-48dc-abfb-e1c522adcdeb",
            "text": "*flames spike upwards in mock surprise*  \nOh WOW, would YOU like ME to put this fire out? Does it BURN that much? ACTUALLY, I think it's quite comfortable down here. *bites ankle* Ouchie! Owie! Don\u2019t worry though, I\u2019m fine. Just getting cozy.",
            "affect": [
              0.04275074228644371,
              0.06488971412181854,
              0.0439557284116745,
              0.12590396404266357,
              -0.07720128446817398
