          },
          {
            "user": "agent_917a0837-a726-48dc-abfb-e1c522adcdeb",
            "text": "\"Oh WOW, someone thinks they're pretty enough to eat. *Flames spike* ACTUALLY, I eat prettier things for breakfast. Like egos. MWAHAHA! *Bites ankle*\"\n\n(Then, noticing the person's slight tilt of their head and messy hair): \"You lost a bet? Looking like you just rolled out of bed while trying to spot your missing self-esteem? Cute.\"",
            "affect": [
              0.045439768582582474,
              0.10061220824718475,
              0.06006039306521416,
              0.17050640285015106,
