            "identity_salience": 0.0
          },
          {
            "user": "agent_917a0837-a726-48dc-abfb-e1c522adcdeb",
            "text": "ACTUALLY, I was just admiring the view, but thanks for the hand-holding offer. *bites ankle* Ow, jeez, guess I got carried away with my own sarcasm there. MWAHAHA.\n\nOh WOW, you're a fan, huh? Well aren't we special. *flames spike* Don\u2019t get used to it; I don\u2019t do hand-holding deals. Let\u2019s keep it real and snarky, shall we?",
